add('b246','以階梯流態含氣與剩餘能量驗證陡槽性能~Verifying stepped-chute regimes aeration and residual energy','以矩形斷面及均勻混合近似作示意，流態分界與氣蝕風險須依專案試驗。~Rectangular sections and uniform-mixture approximations illustrate behavior; regime boundaries and cavitation require project testing.','敏感度：單寬流量由4增至6m2/s時，臨界水深由1.177增為1.542m，增加31.0%；若階高不變，水深階高比隨之提高，但不能用此一比值作通用流態界線。~Sensitivity: raising unit discharge from4 to6m2/s increases critical depth from1.177 to1.542m, about31.0 percent. At fixed step height the relative depth rises, but this ratio alone is not a universal regime boundary.',r'''
臨界水深與單寬流量~Critical depth and unit discharge§階梯流態與流量相對階高有關，先以單寬流量求矩形明渠的臨界水深可建立尺度。此水深不是階面實際平均水深，也不是含氣混合水深；橫向不均流與入口曲率會改變局部條件，需另外量測入口過渡區。~Critical depth based on unit discharge supplies a reference scale for stepped-flow behavior. It is neither the actual mean depth above a step nor the aerated mixture depth. Transverse nonuniformity and entrance curvature alter local conditions and require measurements through the crest transition.§q=4 m2/s; g=9.81 m/s2; criticalDepth=(4**2/9.81)**(1/3)=1.17711 m§以全寬流量積分核對單寬值並標記階高與入口幾何~Check unit discharge by full-width integration and record step height and entrance geometry§把含氣厚度當臨界水深會混淆流態尺度~Using aerated thickness as critical depth confuses the regime scale§臨界水深就是每一階上的實際水深~Critical depth equals actual flow depth on every step§(16/9.81)**(1/3)§1.177109844267211
階高與相對尺度~Step height and relative scale§階高改變水流是否逐階跌落或掠過階尖，水深階高比可整理試驗但還需陡槽坡度與入口邊界。過渡流態可能出現不規則噴濺與波動；不能把某一試驗的分界數值直接當成所有坡度皆適用的設計限制。~Step height influences whether water cascades between steps or skims over their tips. A relative-depth ratio organizes experiments but slope and entrance conditions also matter. Transitional flow may splash irregularly; a boundary observed in one experiment is not a universal design limit across slopes.§criticalDepth=1.2 m; stepHeight=0.6 m; relativeDepth=1.2/0.6=2 dimensionless§在連續變流量試驗中記錄水舌是否撞擊階面及流態轉換~Record nappe impact and regime transitions during a continuous discharge sweep§只測單一流量會漏掉過渡流態的不規則噴濺~Testing one discharge can miss irregular splashing in transitional flow§同一水深階高比保證所有坡度流態相同~The same relative depth guarantees the same regime on every slope§1.2/0.6§2
階梯坡度與建造~Step geometry and construction§階梯由水平踏面與垂直階面組成，整體坡角影響重力沿坡分量、回流穴與施工模板。幾何閉合需核對總落差與總水平長度；局部突出或階尖錯台可能破壞原本流場，不能只驗收平均坡度而忽略局部平整性。~Horizontal treads and vertical risers define the overall slope, influencing gravity components and recirculation cavities. Check total rise and horizontal run together. Local protrusions or displaced edges disturb the intended flow field, so average slope acceptance does not replace local surface and alignment surveys.§stepRise=0.5 m; stepRun=1.0 m; slopeAngle=atan(0.5/1.0)=26.5651 degrees§逐階測量高程與踏面長度並與整體坡線閉合~Survey every riser and tread and close them against the overall slope line§局部突出階尖可能增加低壓與磨耗集中~A projecting step edge can concentrate low pressure and abrasion§平均坡度正確就不必檢查個別階梯~Correct average slope removes the need to inspect individual steps§math.degrees(math.atan(0.5))§26.56505117707799
階穴剪切與耗能~Cavity shear and dissipation§掠流在階尖連線上形成高速主流，階穴內回流透過剪切交換動量與能量。給定平均剪應力乘界面面積及相對速度可估交換功率，但不是完整耗能模型；相對速度與應力需由試驗取得，不能憑階數直接累加能量損失。~Skimming flow passes over step tips while cavity recirculation exchanges momentum through shear. Prescribed mean shear stress, interface area and relative velocity estimate transfer power, not a complete dissipation law. Obtain those quantities experimentally rather than assigning an identical energy loss to every step.§meanShear=400 Pa; interfaceArea=3 m2; relativeVelocity=5 m/s; transferPower=400*3*5/1000=6 kW§比較階穴速度場與界面剪應力並檢查沿程剩餘比能~Compare cavity velocities and interface shear with residual specific energy downstream§把每階耗能當固定常數會忽略沿程流態演變~Assigning constant dissipation to every step ignores evolving flow conditions§只要增加階數總耗能就能無限制線性增加~Adding steps increases total dissipation linearly without limit§400*3*5/1000§6
自含氣起點判讀~Self-aeration inception identification§湍流邊界層向自由水面發展後可開始大量捲氣，起點之前的近壁清水區可能更易受氣蝕影響。以觀測座標描述起點位置並不預測其隨流量變化；應結合壓力、含氣與邊界層量測，不能只看表面是否呈白色。~Air entrainment develops when turbulence reaches the free surface, leaving an upstream clear-water region potentially more vulnerable to cavitation. An observed inception coordinate does not predict its discharge dependence. Combine pressure, concentration and boundary-layer measurements rather than relying on a white surface appearance alone.§Measured inceptionDistance=18 m; totalChuteLength=60 m; clearRegionFraction=18/60=0.30 dimensionless§沿槽測量近壁含氣率並將其與表面白化起點比較~Measure near-wall air concentration along the chute and compare surface whitening onset§表面含氣但近壁仍清水可能留下局部氣蝕風險~An aerated surface with clear water near the wall leaves local cavitation risk§表面變白就保證底部已獲充分含氣保護~A white surface guarantees adequate air protection at the bed§18/60§0.3
混合水深與牆高~Mixture depth and wall height§空氣加入後可使水氣混合層增厚，邊牆需求因此不能只看清水等效深度。均勻含氣率公式僅作截面平均估算，波峰、噴濺與橫向聚流還需額外檢查；牆高也涉及結構與排水，不可直接由一個含氣比決定。~Entrained air thickens the mixture, so wall assessment cannot rely only on clear-water equivalent depth. A uniform-concentration relation estimates a sectional mean, while waves, splash and transverse convergence need additional checks. Wall height also involves structural and drainage requirements beyond one air-fraction calculation.§ClearWaterDepth=0.80 m; meanAirFraction=0.25; mixtureDepth=0.80/(1-0.25)=1.06667 m§以含氣剖面積分核對等效水深並記錄波峰高度~Integrate air profiles to check equivalent water depth and record wave crests§只用平均混合深度配置牆高會漏掉波峰越流~Sizing walls to mean mixture depth alone overlooks wave overtopping§混合層厚度與清水等效深度永遠相同~Mixture thickness always equals clear-water equivalent depth§0.8/(1-0.25)§1.0666666666666667
近壁低壓與氣蝕~Near-wall pressure and cavitation§階尖後方流動分離可產生低壓，局部壓力與蒸氣壓的距離比表面含氣外觀更直接。氣蝕指標需用一致的絕對壓力與參考速度；同一指標下表面缺陷與氣核不同仍會改變起始，因此需對實際階面品質驗證。~Separation behind step edges creates low pressure. Compare local absolute pressure with vapor pressure using a consistent velocity reference. Surface defects and nuclei affect inception even at similar indices; visible aeration does not replace verification of wall conditions and actual near-wall protection.§pAbsolute=80 kPa; vaporPressure=2.3 kPa; rho=1000 kg/m3; V=18 m/s; sigma=(80000-2300)/(0.5*1000*18**2)=0.479630§同步量測階尖後低壓與近壁含氣率並記錄表面缺陷~Measure downstream-edge pressure and near-wall air together and document surface defects§把表壓直接代入會錯估距蒸氣壓的餘量~Inserting gauge pressure directly misstates the margin above vapor pressure§表壓可直接與絕對蒸氣壓相減~Gauge pressure can be subtracted directly from absolute vapor pressure§(80000-2300)/(0.5*1000*18**2)§0.47962962962962963
下游剩餘能量~Downstream residual energy§階梯可在陡槽沿程耗能，但下游仍有速度水頭與水深所含比能，需要與尾水和消能池配合。以矩形清水等效斷面估比能時應明示速度分布修正假設；不應因階梯表面看似激烈翻滾就宣稱可以省去末端消能。~Steps dissipate energy along the chute, yet depth and velocity head remain at its end. Coordinate that residual energy with tailwater and terminal dissipation. A rectangular clear-water equivalent section assumes a velocity-distribution correction; vigorous visible turbulence does not prove that a terminal basin is unnecessary.§depth=1.1 m; meanV=8 m/s; energyCoefficient=1; specificEnergy=1.1+8**2/(2*9.81)=4.36198 m§比較槽末清水等效比能與消能池入流工況表~Compare terminal clear-water equivalent energy with basin approach-condition tables§忽略剩餘速度水頭會低估下游沖刷需求~Ignoring residual velocity head understates downstream scour demand§有階梯溢洪道就一定不需要末端消能~Every stepped spillway eliminates the need for terminal dissipation§1.1+64/(2*9.81)§4.361977573904179
接縫滲壓與穩定~Joint pressure and slab stability§階梯混凝土接縫可能將表面動壓傳入底部，反覆升降的底板下壓力影響錨定與接觸。平均淨水頭只給靜態揚力量級，堵塞排水與脈動相關性需另考慮；驗證必須涵蓋接縫、底層與排水出口的連續水路。~Concrete joints can transmit surface pressure beneath stepped slabs and impose cyclic uplift. Mean differential head provides a static scale only; drain blockage and pressure correlation need separate treatment. Verification must trace the connected route through joints, the underlying layer and drainage outlets.§NetUnderSlabHead=1.5 m; slabArea=12 m2; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; uplift=1.5*12*9.81=176.58 kN§量測接縫兩側與底板下壓力並核對排水出口流量~Measure pressures across joints and beneath slabs and check drainage outlet flow§排水堵塞會讓接縫入水轉成持續底板揚壓~A blocked drain converts joint inflow into sustained slab uplift§階梯表面耗能良好就代表底板不會受揚壓~Effective surface dissipation means slabs cannot experience uplift§1.5*12*9.81§176.58
縮尺黏性與可比性~Scale viscosity and comparability§同水質福祿模型的速度隨長度平方根縮小，使雷諾數比按長度比的二分之三次方改變。小模型可能改變階穴紊流與含氣，結果需附尺度限制；應分開驗證整體水面線與細部氣泡機制，不能用單一相似準則涵蓋所有現象。~In a same-fluid Froude model, velocity scales with square root of length, making the Reynolds-number ratio length to the three-halves power. Small models may change cavity turbulence and aeration. Report scale limits and distinguish whole-profile validation from detailed bubble mechanisms rather than assuming universal similarity.§Prototype/model lengthRatio=20; same kinematicViscosity; ReynoldsRatio=20**1.5=89.4427 dimensionless§列出原型與模型雷諾數並比較兩種模型尺度的含氣結果~List prototype and model Reynolds numbers and compare aeration at two model scales§模型黏性過強會改變階穴交換與表面擾動~Excessive model viscosity changes cavity exchange and surface disturbance§相同福祿數也保證雷諾數自動相同~Equal Froude numbers also guarantee equal Reynolds numbers§20**1.5§89.44271909999159
''')
add('b247','以側向入流動量及沿程水面控制側槽~Controlling side channels through lateral inflow momentum and profiles','側槽具有空間變流，示意分段平均不代替完整三維模型與沿程動量求解。~Side channels have spatially varied flow; segmented averages do not replace three-dimensional modeling and longitudinal momentum analysis.','敏感度：均勻側入流由每公尺2增至3m2/s且側槽長40m時，總流量由80增至120m3/s；若出口面積維持20m2，平均速度由4增為6m/s，動量與能量需求不只增加50%。~Sensitivity: increasing uniform lateral inflow from2 to3m2/s along40m raises discharge from80 to120m3/s. At a fixed20m2 outlet area, velocity rises from4 to6m/s; momentum and energy demands grow faster than the50-percent discharge increase.',r'''
沿程入流與累積~Lateral inflow accumulation§側槽接收沿堰長分布的側向水流，流量沿下游增加，因此不能用一個固定流量套全槽。先把側入流分布積分，再檢查各段斷面與出口控制；堰上水頭不均或局部淹沒會破壞均勻入流假設。~A side channel accumulates distributed lateral inflow, so discharge increases downstream. Integrate the inflow distribution before checking sections and outlet control rather than applying one discharge everywhere. Unequal crest heads or local submergence invalidate the uniform-inflow approximation and require segmented measurements.§Uniform lateral input=2 m2/s; channelLength=40 m; upstreamQ=0; outletQ=2*40=80 m3/s§分段量測堰上水頭並將側入流累積量與出口流量比對~Measure crest head by segment and compare accumulated inflow with outlet discharge§局部堰頂淹沒會改變沿程入流分配~Local crest submergence changes the longitudinal inflow distribution§側槽上游與下游的流量永遠完全相同~Discharge is always identical upstream and downstream in a side channel§2*40§80
長堰流量與水頭~Long crest discharge and head§側槽可提供較長堰頂以降低特定流量所需水頭，但係數仍受入口形狀、接近流與淹沒控制。自由堰公式只適用所假設的係數與單位；堰長增加不保證出口通道有足夠容量，應聯合分析槽內回水。~A long crest can reduce the head needed for discharge, but coefficient, approach flow and submergence remain important. A free-weir equation applies only to its stated geometry and units. More crest length does not guarantee outlet capacity because channel backwater may suppress the intended inflow.§Assumed coefficient C=1.7 m0.5/s; crestLength=30 m; head=1.2 m; Q=1.7*30*1.2**1.5=67.0412 m3/s§比較各堰段水頭與實測流量並標示淹沒工況~Compare head and measured discharge for each crest segment and identify submergence§只增加堰長但不檢查側槽容量可能使堰頂回水淹沒~Increasing crest length without channel checks can submerge the crest through backwater§堰頂加長就一定可無限制增加整體洩量~Lengthening the crest increases total system discharge without limit§1.7*30*1.2**1.5§67.04124103863232
側入動量與轉向~Lateral momentum and turning§垂直於槽軸的側入流需轉向後才沿槽輸送，其軸向初始動量可能很小，不能使用只含能量損失的普通渠道公式忽略混合作用。控制體應包含各入口速度向量、壁面反力與壓力力，簡化動量差只展示其中一項。~Lateral inflow must turn into the channel axis and may carry little initial axial momentum. Ordinary channel calculations that only add an energy-loss coefficient can miss mixing forces. A control volume needs inlet velocity vectors, wall reactions and pressure forces; a simplified momentum difference illustrates only one contribution.§rho=1000 kg/m3; axialOutflow=80 m3/s at4 m/s; lateral axial velocity=0; outgoingAxialMomentum=1000*80*4/1000=320 kN§以三維速度量測確認側入方向並核對控制體各面動量~Measure three-dimensional velocity and reconcile momentum across every control-volume face§忽略側向混合會誤判沿程水深與壁面反力~Ignoring lateral mixing misstates channel depth and wall reactions§側向入流可當作早已沿槽流動的水量~Lateral inflow can be treated as water already moving along the channel§1000*80*4/1000§320
斷面速度與水深~Section velocity and depth§側槽寬度和水深共同提供逐漸增加的通水面積，單純以平均速度限值配置寬度會漏掉回流與旋轉。連續方程可核對量測是否一致，但不能獨自決定水面線；需同時滿足動量、底坡與下游邊界。~Width and depth provide area for increasing downstream flow. A mean-velocity target alone misses recirculation and rotation. Continuity checks whether measurements agree but cannot determine the water profile independently of momentum, bed slope and the downstream boundary; use it as one equation within the system.§Q=90 m3/s; width=8 m; depth=3 m; meanV=90/(8*3)=3.75 m/s§用分層流速剖面檢查平均速度及回流面積~Use layered velocity profiles to check mean speed and recirculating area§把回流區算成有效順流面積會低估主流速度~Counting recirculation as effective downstream area understates main-stream velocity§連續方程單獨就能求出整條側槽水面線~Continuity alone determines the complete side-channel water profile§90/(8*3)§3.75
出口臨界控制~Critical outlet control§出口收縮或跌水可能建立臨界控制並把回水影響傳回側槽，需將出口與側向堰頂聯合評估。矩形臨界深度只對指定單寬流量成立；若有含氣、斜交或非矩形斷面，需用適用水力深度及完整模型。~An outlet contraction or drop may impose critical control and send backwater upstream toward the lateral crest. Evaluate the outlet and side weir jointly. Rectangular critical depth applies to a specified unit discharge; aeration, oblique approach or different geometry requires a more suitable formulation.§Q=80 m3/s; outletWidth=8 m; q=10 m2/s; criticalDepth=(10**2/9.81)**(1/3)=2.16825 m§量測出口附近水面線並檢查控制斷面是否隨流量遷移~Measure the outlet profile and determine whether the control section shifts with discharge§漏掉出口控制會低估側槽上游水位~Missing outlet control underestimates upstream channel level§出口控制只影響出口不會影響側槽上游~Outlet control affects only the outlet and never the upstream side channel§(100/9.81)**(1/3)§2.168254871820043
橫向水位與彎流~Transverse level and curved flow§側流轉向與彎道可使橫向水位傾斜，平均縱向水面線不能代表外側牆邊最高水位。曲率平衡簡式以均勻速度和大半徑近似，回流與湍流時只能提供量級；需分別觀測內外側水位與波峰。~Turning flow can tilt the transverse water surface, so a mean longitudinal profile does not capture the highest wall level. A curvature balance assumes approximately uniform velocity and gentle curvature; recirculating turbulent flow makes it only a scale estimate. Observe both banks and wave crests independently.§V=4 m/s; width=6 m; curvatureRadius=30 m; levelDifference=4**2*6/(9.81*30)=0.326198 m§同步量測內外側水位與波峰並對照轉彎速度場~Measure levels and crests at both walls simultaneously alongside turning velocities§只在內側設水位計會漏掉外側越流~A gauge only at the inner wall can miss outer-wall overtopping§側槽同一斷面的水面必定完全水平~The water surface must be perfectly level across every side-channel section§16*6/(9.81*30)§0.326197757390418
波峰餘高與牆頂~Wave allowance and wall crest§側入水舌的碰撞會產生交叉波與噴濺，牆頂核對需區分平均水深、波幅與測量不確定度。簡單加總只整理已選定工況的幾何餘量，不會自動提供完整可靠度；洪水歷線與短暫浪峰仍要在試驗中覆蓋。~Colliding lateral jets generate cross-waves and splash. Separate mean depth, wave amplitude and measurement uncertainty when checking a wall crest. A simple sum organizes geometry for an assumed case rather than establishing reliability; test hydrographs and short-lived crests as part of the boundary coverage.§wallHeight=5 m; meanDepth=3.6 m; waveCrestAboveMean=0.8 m; geometricClearance=5-3.6-0.8=0.60 m§以高頻水位與影像核對最大浪峰是否集中於局部牆段~Use rapid level records and imagery to locate concentrated wave crests along walls§時間平均水深會掩蓋短暫越頂噴流~Time-averaged depth conceals brief overtopping jets§平均水面低於牆頂就保證不會越流~A mean water surface below the wall guarantees no overtopping§5-3.6-0.8§0.6
底板排水與回水~Floor drainage and backwater§側槽底板可能同時受地下水與表面變動壓力作用，排水出口若被下游水淹沒，原本自由排水條件會改變。淨水頭差應使用同時工況而非把不同洪水時刻的極值拼接；排水失效需與結構抗浮共同檢查。~Groundwater and fluctuating surface pressure act on the floor together. A submerged drainage outlet changes the original free-drainage boundary. Use simultaneous states for differential head rather than combining incompatible extremes from different times, and evaluate drainage failure alongside structural uplift resistance.§underFloorHead=108 m; surfaceHead=105 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; netPressure=(108-105)*9.81=29.43 kPa§同步量測底板上下水頭並檢查排水出口淹沒時段~Measure heads above and below the floor together and identify outlet submergence periods§下游回水使排水反灌可升高底板下壓力~Downstream backwater can reverse drainage and raise subfloor pressure§排水孔存在就保證底板下沒有揚壓~The presence of drains guarantees no pressure beneath the floor§(108-105)*9.81§29.43
漂流木與有效堰長~Debris and effective crest length§漂流木可能卡在堰口與局部支柱，使有效堰長減少並改變側向入流分布。若暫時假設係數不變，可用堰長比估流量變化，但真實堵塞也會改變接近流與局部水頭；應以不同堵塞位置而非單一比例驗證。~Debris can reduce effective crest length and redistribute lateral inflow. A length-ratio estimate holds the coefficient and head fixed, while real blockage also changes approach flow and local head. Test different blockage locations rather than assuming one percentage completely describes the hydraulic consequence.§fixedHeadAndCoefficient; clearLength=40 m; blockedLength=10 m; remainingCapacityFraction=(40-10)/40=0.75§以多種堵塞位置觀察槽內水位與入流分配改變~Observe level and inflow redistribution for several debris-blockage locations§相同堵塞比例位於出口附近可能造成更強局部回水~The same blockage fraction near the outlet can produce stronger local backwater§堵塞百分比相同就代表水力影響完全相同~Equal blockage percentages always produce identical hydraulic effects§(40-10)/40§0.75
模型守恆與驗證~Model conservation and validation§三維側槽試驗或數值模型需同時通過水量平衡與水面線比較，單一出口流量吻合不代表流場正確。用控制體殘差可找出量測或網格問題，但小殘差也可能伴隨錯誤的紊流與邊界設定；應另比較局部波動與速度。~A three-dimensional side-channel model needs both mass balance and profile validation. Matching outlet discharge does not prove the flow field. A control-volume residual flags measurement or discretization issues, but a small residual can coexist with wrong turbulence or boundaries; compare local velocities and fluctuations independently.§MeasuredInflow=100 m3/s; measuredOutflow=98 m3/s; steady residual=(100-98)/100*100=2 percent§核對各入口總量與出口量並比較獨立水位測線~Reconcile all inlet and outlet flows and compare independent water-level transects§只調參至流量守恆可能保留錯誤水面與流速分布~Tuning only for mass balance can preserve incorrect water-level and velocity distributions§水量守恆通過就證明整個三維模型完全正確~Passing mass balance proves that the entire three-dimensional model is correct§(100-98)/100*100§2
''')
add('b248','辨識豎井溢洪道的堰流孔流通氣與控制轉換~Distinguishing shaft-spillway weir orifice ventilation and control transitions','各算例分屬不同控制工況，不可把自由堰流與滿管流公式同時套在同一斷面。~Examples represent different control regimes; free-weir and full-pipe relations must not be applied simultaneously at one section.','敏感度：自由堰流近似下水頭由1增至1.5m，流量比為1.5的1.5次方即1.837；若轉為孔口控制且面積不變，同樣水頭比的流量比只有平方根1.225，因此需要確認控制轉換。~Sensitivity: under free-weir control, increasing head from1 to1.5m gives a discharge ratio of1.837. Under fixed-area orifice control the same head ratio gives only1.225. A rating must therefore identify the change in control.',r'''
環形堰頂自由流~Circular crest free flow§鐘口入口在低水頭下可近似環形堰流，周長提供有效堰長。接近流旋轉、墩柱與局部淹沒會降低均勻性；示意係數不能跨幾何直接沿用。水頭增加後控制可能移往喉部與隧道，應避免以同一冪次延伸整條率定曲線。~At low head a bellmouth can behave approximately as a circular weir, with circumference supplying crest length. Swirl, piers and submergence reduce uniformity. An illustrative coefficient cannot transfer across geometries, and higher heads may move control to the throat or tunnel rather than preserve one power law.§Assumed C=1.7 m0.5/s; crestDiameter=10 m; H=1 m; Q=1.7*pi*10*1**1.5=53.4071 m3/s§沿環形堰頂量測水頭並觀察各方位水舌是否對稱~Measure head around the circular crest and observe whether nappes are symmetric§偏心接近流會形成非均勻溢流並改變率定~Eccentric approach flow creates nonuniform overflow and changes the rating§環形堰率定可以延伸到任何高水頭工況~A circular-weir rating remains valid at every high-head condition§1.7*math.pi*10§53.40707511102648
喉部孔口控制~Throat orifice control§喉部淹沒後可能由有效孔口面積與水頭差控制流量，流量對水頭的反應比自由堰流緩。排氣、下游壓力與流量係數都會影響此關係；孔口公式並不描述控制轉換期間的劇烈波動，需以連續升降流量試驗辨認。~Once submerged, the throat may act as an orifice governed by effective area and head difference. Discharge then responds less strongly to head than free-weir flow. Venting, downstream pressure and coefficient matter, and the equation does not describe unstable transitions between these regimes.§Cd=0.75; throatArea=12 m2; effectiveHead=8 m; Q=0.75*12*sqrt(2*9.81*8)=112.755 m3/s§在升流與降流過程比較喉部壓力和水位流量曲線~Compare throat pressure and stage-discharge curves during increasing and decreasing flow§控制轉換滯回可能使同水位出現不同流量~Transition hysteresis may produce different discharges at the same stage§孔口控制的流量仍必定與水頭一點五次方成正比~Orifice discharge must remain proportional to head to the three-halves power§0.75*12*math.sqrt(2*9.81*8)§112.75531029623394
豎井通水與空芯~Shaft water area and air core§豎井中沿壁水膜與中央空氣芯可能並存，水量連續應只用液相過水面積。簡化環狀截面忽略含氣與非均勻流速，仍可提醒學生不能將整個井徑都算成水流面積；空芯縮小也會改變通氣和壓力邊界。~A wall-attached water layer can surround an air core. Liquid continuity therefore uses the water area rather than the full shaft. A simple annulus omits aeration and velocity variation but shows why air-core changes affect both mean liquid speed and the ventilation boundary.§shaftDiameter=5 m; airCoreDiameter=3 m; liquidArea=pi*(5**2-3**2)/4=12.5664 m2§以影像或含氣探針確認空芯尺寸並核對液相流量~Use imaging or air probes to establish air-core size and check liquid discharge§空芯收縮可能使原本開放通氣轉成受限流動~Air-core contraction can turn open ventilation into restricted flow§整個豎井截面在所有工況都充滿液態水~The entire shaft section contains liquid water in every operating regime§math.pi*(25-9)/4§12.566370614359172
通氣需求與管徑~Vent demand and duct area§水流捲帶空氣進入下游通道，補氣不足會造成低壓與不穩定振盪。給定空氣體積流量與允許平均速度可作截面盤點，不能代替可壓縮流與入口損失分析；空氣體積需標明當地壓力溫度，否則密度與流量不可比。~Entrained air must be replaced through ventilation paths; insufficient supply can cause low pressure and oscillation. Area from specified air volume and speed is only a continuity check, not compressible-flow or inlet-loss analysis. State local pressure and temperature when reporting air volume to preserve comparability.§AirVolumeAtLocalConditions=15 m3/s; meanAirVelocity=12 m/s; requiredFlowArea=15/12=1.25 m2§同步記錄通氣管空氣流量與井內絕對壓力~Record vent airflow and shaft absolute pressure simultaneously§鳥網或雜物堵塞會增加通氣阻力並放大負壓~Screens or debris blockage increases ventilation resistance and deepens subpressure§通氣管存在就保證任何流量下都能充分補氣~A vent pipe guarantees adequate air supply at every water discharge§15/12§1.25
旋渦環流與水頭~Swirl circulation and head§不對稱接近流可能產生環流與空氣渦，局部旋轉速度會降低中心壓力並影響進流容量。自由渦近似僅在指定半徑之外有效，靠近渦核不能任意外推至無限速度；抗渦構件應以模型驗證其阻水與導流作用。~Asymmetric approach flow can create circulation and an air-core vortex. Tangential velocity affects central pressure and inlet capacity. A free-vortex model applies only outside a specified core and cannot be extrapolated to infinite center velocity; test antivortex devices for both flow guidance and obstruction.§Circulation=20 m2/s; radius=2 m; tangentialV=20/(2*pi*2)=1.59155 m/s§以表面追蹤與速度量測辨識環流方向和渦核範圍~Track the surface and measure velocities to identify circulation and core extent§只降低平均入流速度可能仍保留強烈環流~Reducing mean approach speed alone may leave strong circulation§平均入流速度低就不可能形成進水旋渦~Low mean approach speed makes inlet vortices impossible§20/(2*math.pi*2)§1.5915494309189535
豎井底彎轉動量~Bottom bend momentum change§落水在井底彎轉為水平流時，方向改變形成明顯作用力，壓力與速度沿彎道分布不均。簡化等速直角轉彎的向量差只計動量項，實際支承作用還含壓力力與水重；不可直接把此單項當成彎道完整設計荷載。~At the shaft bottom, flow turns from vertical to horizontal and generates substantial reaction. An equal-speed right-angle vector difference estimates only momentum change. Real support loads also include pressure forces and water weight, so that single component is not the complete bend design load.§rho=1000 kg/m3; Q=60 m3/s; V=10 m/s; rightAngleMomentumMagnitude=sqrt(2)*1000*60*10/1000=848.528 kN§以彎道壓力積分及入口出口速度向量核對受力方向~Check force direction using bend-pressure integration and inlet-outlet velocity vectors§漏列壓力力會使支承反力估算不完整~Omitting pressure forces leaves the support-reaction estimate incomplete§動量變化單項就是井底彎道全部荷載~Momentum change alone equals the entire bottom-bend load§math.sqrt(2)*1000*60*10/1000§848.5281374238571
下游管流摩阻~Downstream conduit friction§當下游通道滿流時，沿程摩阻消耗水頭並可能回控豎井容量；自由水面流則需不同計算架構。達西摩阻係數與管長徑比必須配套使用，接頭、彎道與出入口損失另列，不能因管徑大就忽略整段水頭需求。~A full downstream conduit loses head to friction and may control shaft capacity; free-surface operation needs another framework. Use Darcy friction factor consistently with length-to-diameter ratio and list local losses separately. A large diameter does not eliminate the head demand along a long conduit.§Full pipe: DarcyF=0.018; L=300 m; D=4 m; V=8 m/s; headLoss=0.018*(300/4)*8**2/(2*9.81)=4.40367 m§以沿管壓力測點核對摩阻坡降並辨認是否滿流~Use pressure taps to check friction gradient and establish whether the conduit is full§在明滿流交替時套單一穩態管流式會漏掉壓力跳動~One steady pipe-flow formula misses pressure changes during mixed free-surface and full flow§下游管徑夠大就可以忽略全部摩阻~A sufficiently large downstream pipe permits ignoring all friction losses§0.018*(300/4)*64/(2*9.81)§4.403669724770642
控制轉換與庫容~Control transition and reservoir storage§豎井洩量率定的斜率變小時，新增入流可能更多轉為庫水位上升，應把水庫蓄水方程與溢洪道控制連接。定面積短時近似只表示水量差，不含變動庫容曲線與時間相依洩量；完整洪水演算不能靠單一靜態率定點。~When the discharge-rating slope decreases, more incoming water may become reservoir storage. Couple continuity to the spillway control relation. A constant-area short-interval estimate illustrates imbalance but omits changing storage geometry and time-dependent outflow; one static rating point cannot route a flood.§Inflow=150 m3/s; outflow=110 m3/s; interval=600 s; reservoirArea=2000000 m2; stageRise=(150-110)*600/2000000=0.012 m§用同時入出流與水位量測核對庫容變化並檢查率定斜率~Reconcile simultaneous inflow, outflow and stage change and inspect rating-curve slope§延用自由堰流高斜率會低估轉換後水位上升~Extending the steep free-weir rating understates stage rise after control changes§靜態單點洩量足以完成任何洪水演算~One static discharge point is sufficient to route every flood§40*600/2000000§0.012
漂流物與局部堵塞~Floating debris and local blockage§鐘口附近漂流物可形成環狀或偏心堵塞，既減少有效入口又引入不對稱旋流。單純面積減量只作幾何示意，實際洩量還受堆積形狀與通氣影響；試驗需涵蓋不同漂流物位置以及清除前後的水位反應。~Debris around a bellmouth can block the inlet asymmetrically and induce swirl. An area deduction describes geometry only; discharge also depends on accumulation shape and ventilation. Test different positions and examine stage response before and after removal instead of equating blockage area with discharge loss.§NominalOpenArea=20 m2; blockedArea=6 m2; openFraction=(20-6)/20=0.70§以多種堵塞布置觀察偏流旋渦與通氣壓力變化~Observe asymmetric flow, vortices and ventilation pressures for several blockage layouts§偏心堵塞可能同時削弱洩量與補氣~Eccentric blockage may reduce both discharge and ventilation§堵塞面積減少三成就保證洩量只減三成~A thirty-percent area blockage guarantees exactly thirty-percent discharge loss§(20-6)/20§0.7
瞬變量測與取樣~Transient measurement and sampling§控制轉換伴隨的壓力振盪可能比水位平均變化快，量測系統需足夠採樣率並處理抗混疊。奈奎斯特條件只是避免理想頻率折疊的最低要求，不代表波形與尖峰已被精確重建；需根據實際頻帶與感測器響應安排記錄。~Pressure oscillations during control transitions may be faster than mean stage changes. Sampling and anti-alias filtering must cover the relevant band. Nyquist is a minimum ideal condition, not a guarantee of accurate waveform or peak reconstruction; account for the sensor response and observed frequency content.§HighestIllustrativeFrequency=8 Hz; theoreticalNyquistRate=2*8=16 samples/s; actual acquisition requires additional margin§以較高採樣率對照頻譜並測試感測器動態響應~Compare spectra at a higher rate and test the pressure sensor dynamic response§未濾波的高頻振動可能折疊成假低頻壓力週期~Unfiltered high-frequency vibration can alias into a false low-frequency pressure cycle§只達兩倍頻率就保證所有壓力尖峰量測準確~Sampling at twice the frequency guarantees accurate measurement of every pressure peak§2*8§16
''')
add('b249','由絕對壓力缺陷含氣與修補驗證氣蝕防治~Verifying cavitation mitigation through absolute pressure defects aeration and repair','氣蝕指標與含氣算例只作機制比較，起蝕門檻依表面幾何水質與流況而變。~Cavitation indices and aeration examples compare mechanisms; inception thresholds depend on surface geometry water quality and flow conditions.','敏感度：絕對壓力100kPa與蒸氣壓2.3kPa不變，速度由20增至30m/s，氣蝕指標由0.4885降至0.2171；速度增加50%使動壓增加125%，但不能由指標直接預報破壞速率。~Sensitivity: holding absolute pressure at100kPa and vapor pressure at2.3kPa, increasing speed from20 to30m/s lowers the index from0.4885 to0.2171. Dynamic pressure increases125 percent, but the index alone does not predict damage rate.',r'''
絕對壓力與蒸氣壓~Absolute pressure and vapor pressure§氣蝕涉及局部壓力接近液體蒸氣壓，兩者必須使用相同絕對壓力基準。高程與天氣會改變大氣壓，水溫則改變蒸氣壓；把表壓直接相減會嚴重錯估餘量。量測時須記錄壓力校正與溫度，而非只報單一負壓數值。~Cavitation concerns local pressure approaching vapor pressure, both on an absolute basis. Altitude and weather affect atmospheric pressure while temperature affects vapor pressure. Subtracting gauge pressure directly gives the wrong margin; record pressure calibration and temperature instead of reporting only one negative gauge value.§atmosphericPressure=90 kPa; gaugePressure=-35 kPa; absolutePressure=90-35=55 kPa§將氣壓計與壓力感測器零點校正對齊並記錄水溫~Align barometer and pressure-sensor zero checks and record water temperature§混用表壓與絕對壓會錯估距離氣化條件的餘量~Mixing gauge and absolute pressure misstates the margin to vapor formation§表壓負值就表示液體一定已達蒸氣壓~Any negative gauge pressure proves that liquid has reached vapor pressure§90-35§55
氣蝕指標與速度~Cavitation index and velocity§氣蝕指標把高於蒸氣壓的壓力餘量除以參考動壓，可比較局部低壓對高速水流的相對程度。分母速度必須與起蝕資料使用相同定義；指標不是破壞速率，表面不平整、氣核與含氣保護仍會改變實際結果。~The cavitation index normalizes pressure margin above vapor pressure by a reference dynamic pressure. Its velocity definition must match the inception data used for comparison. The index is not a damage-rate law; surface irregularities, nuclei and protective aeration still affect the physical outcome.§pAbsolute=100 kPa; pVapor=2.3 kPa; rho=1000 kg/m3; V=20 m/s; sigma=(100000-2300)/(0.5*1000*20**2)=0.4885§同步量測參考速度與局部壓力並標明指標定義~Measure reference velocity and local pressure together and state the index definition§採不同位置速度比較門檻會造成不一致判讀~Using velocities from different reference locations makes threshold comparisons inconsistent§氣蝕指標數值可直接換算成混凝土磨損速率~The cavitation index directly converts into a concrete damage rate§(100000-2300)/(0.5*1000*400)§0.4885
錯台尺度與流動分離~Offset scale and separation§迎流錯台使水流突然偏轉，背後低壓與渦流可能觸發氣蝕；缺陷方向和尖銳程度比單純高度更重要。相對粗糙度可描述尺度但不能提供通用允收值，施工驗收須保留沿流方向的剖面及表面修整紀錄。~An upstream-facing offset abruptly deflects flow and creates low pressure and vortices behind it. Orientation and sharpness matter alongside height. Relative roughness describes scale but is not a universal tolerance; acceptance needs profiles along the flow direction and documented surface finishing.§offsetHeight=0.004 m; localFlowDepth=0.80 m; relativeOffset=0.004/0.80=0.005 dimensionless§用沿流剖面儀量測錯台方向高度與前後坡度~Profile the surface along flow to measure offset direction, height and adjoining slopes§只量垂直高度會漏掉尖銳迎流邊緣的分離效應~Measuring height alone misses separation at a sharp upstream-facing edge§相同錯台高度不論方向都有相同氣蝕影響~Equal offset heights have identical cavitation effects in every orientation§0.004/0.8§0.005
低壓脈動與極值~Low-pressure fluctuations and extremes§平均壓力高於蒸氣壓不表示所有瞬間都安全，紊流脈動可能產生短暫低壓。高斯近似可示範統計尾部但未必適用實際尖峰；應保存原始高頻資料並分析持續時間、空間相關與感測器頻率響應，避免只用平均值判讀。~A mean above vapor pressure does not exclude brief low-pressure excursions. A Gaussian illustration describes a statistical tail but may not fit actual spikes. Preserve high-rate records and analyze duration, spatial correlation and sensor response rather than judging the condition from the average alone.§Illustrative meanAbsolutePressure=70 kPa; standardDeviation=15 kPa; meanMinus3SD=70-3*15=25 kPa; no physical minimum implied§檢查低壓事件的持續時間與相鄰測點是否同步~Examine excursion duration and synchronization between neighboring pressure sensors§將均值減三倍標準差當絕對下限會漏掉非高斯尖峰~Treating mean minus three deviations as a hard minimum misses non-Gaussian spikes§平均壓力高於蒸氣壓就排除所有瞬間氣蝕~Mean pressure above vapor pressure excludes every transient cavitation event§70-3*15§25
摻氣量與相分率~Air supply and phase fraction§供氣可緩和氣泡潰滅附近的局部壓力衝擊，但入口總氣量不等於近壁保護濃度。水氣體積比需以相同壓力溫度定義，並區分氣水比與混合物空隙率；氣泡滑移與沿程脫氣使兩者的空間分布更複雜。~Air supply can cushion local collapse pressures, but total supplied air is not near-wall protective concentration. Use consistent pressure and temperature and distinguish air-to-water volume ratio from mixture void fraction. Bubble slip and downstream detrainment complicate the spatial distribution further.§Qa=6 m3/s andQw=54 m3/s at common conditions; bulkVoidFraction=6/(6+54)=0.10§同步量測供氣管流量與底部含氣剖面並標記壓力溫度~Measure vent supply and near-bed air profiles together with pressure and temperature§總供氣量正常但氣泡浮離底部仍可能缺乏保護~Normal total supply can coexist with poor protection when bubbles leave the bed§總供氣量足夠就保證每個壁面都有足夠含氣~Adequate total air supply guarantees adequate aeration at every wall§6/(6+54)§0.1
通氣管損失與負壓~Vent losses and suction§摻氣槽形成的空腔需透過通氣管補氣，管路阻力會降低空腔壓力並影響射流軌跡。低馬赫數近似可用局部損失估壓差；若壓差大或接近可壓縮限制，必須改用適當氣體流模型，不可直接照搬不可壓縮公式。~Aerator cavities draw air through ducts whose resistance changes cavity pressure and jet shape. At low Mach number, a local-loss relation estimates pressure drop. Large pressure differences or compressibility limits require a gas-flow model instead of unconditional use of an incompressible expression.§Low-Mach air: rhoAir=1.2 kg/m3; lossK=3; airV=20 m/s; pressureLoss=3*0.5*1.2*20**2=720 Pa§量測通氣口與空腔壓差並檢查網罩和轉彎阻力~Measure inlet-to-cavity pressure drop and inspect screens and bends§通氣入口堵塞可降低供氣並加深空腔負壓~A blocked vent inlet reduces supply and deepens cavity suction§空腔越負壓就表示摻氣保護一定越好~Stronger cavity suction always means better aeration protection§3*0.5*1.2*400§720
拋離空腔與再附著~Jet cavity and reattachment§摻氣坎讓水流暫時離開底板並在下方形成供氣空腔，水舌再附著位置影響近壁含氣與局部壓力。水平拋射簡式只估無阻力的中心線，不代表含氣分布；設計需同時檢查空腔是否淹沒與再附著後的保護長度。~An aerator ramp lifts flow from the floor and forms an air cavity. Reattachment affects near-wall air and pressure. A horizontal ballistic estimate gives only a drag-free centerline, not concentration. Check cavity drowning and protection downstream of reattachment as separate performance questions.§HorizontalLaunchV=15 m/s; drop=0.20 m; flightTime=sqrt(2*0.20/9.81); range=15*sqrt(0.4/9.81)=3.02891 m§以影像量測空腔長度並檢查再附著後近壁含氣~Measure cavity length optically and inspect near-wall air downstream of reattachment§尾水或水深增大可能淹沒空腔並切斷補氣~Higher water depth can drown the cavity and interrupt air supply§只要有摻氣坎就不可能發生空腔淹沒~The presence of an aerator ramp makes cavity drowning impossible§15*math.sqrt(0.4/9.81)§3.0289126640769135
損傷盤點與體積~Damage mapping and volume§氣蝕損傷可能由局部凹坑成長並改變後續流場，修補前需建立可重複的地形基準。面積乘平均深度只是體積盤點，不能把它當作未來線性損傷率；磨耗、化學侵蝕與鋼筋剝露需分別辨認並追溯操作歷程。~Cavitation pits can grow and alter subsequent flow. Establish a repeatable surface datum before repair. Area times mean depth estimates lost volume, not a linear future damage rate. Distinguish abrasion, chemical deterioration and exposed reinforcement and relate each to the operating history.§damagedArea=12 m2; meanLossDepth=0.025 m; lostVolume=12*0.025=0.30 m3§用重複三維掃描比較凹坑位置體積並保留運轉流量紀錄~Compare repeated three-dimensional pit maps and volumes against operating discharge records§以單次平均損傷量線性外推可能漏掉幾何惡化的加速效應~Linear extrapolation from one survey misses acceleration caused by worsening geometry§一次損傷體積可直接預報未來每年的固定損失~One damage-volume survey predicts a fixed annual future loss§12*0.025§0.3
修補黏結與平整~Repair bond and surface continuity§修補材料需與基材共同承受水力脈壓及溫度變形，表面平順與黏結完整同樣重要。拉拔試驗只檢查局部黏結樣本，不能證明整片無空鼓；施工記錄應包含基面處理、養護與沿流接縫輪廓，避免修補本身形成新缺陷。~Repairs must transfer hydraulic pulses and thermal deformation to the substrate. Smoothness and bond continuity both matter. Pull-off tests sample local adhesion and cannot prove an entire patch void-free; document preparation, curing and flowwise joint profiles so the repair does not create another initiating defect.§PullOffLoad=9 kN; testArea=0.003 m2; nominalBondStress=9/0.003/1000=3 MPa§結合拉拔位置圖敲測或適用非破壞檢查與表面剖面~Combine mapped pull-off locations, suitable void detection and surface profiles§局部拉拔合格仍可能存在未取樣的空鼓帶~Passing local pull-off tests can coexist with an unsampled debonded strip§一個拉拔試點合格就證明整片修補完全黏結~One passing pull-off test proves complete bond over the entire repair§9/0.003/1000§3
運轉曝露與追蹤~Operating exposure and follow-up§氣蝕損傷與高風險工況的持續時間有關，但不同流速與壓力不能以相同小時數直接等價。曝露時數可建立追蹤帳，仍須按流量、水位、含氣與缺陷狀態分組；修補後對照試驗應保持工況可比，才能辨識改善。~Damage depends on exposure to adverse conditions, but hours at different pressures and velocities are not equivalent. An exposure ledger supports tracking only when grouped by discharge, stage, aeration and surface condition. Postrepair comparisons need matched states before attributing changes to the repair.§Three identified operating intervals=2.5,1.0,3.5 h; totalRecordedExposure=2.5+1.0+3.5=7 h; no linear damage law§按流量水位與含氣狀態分組比較修補前後檢測~Group inspections by discharge, stage and aeration when comparing before and after repair§只比較總時數會掩蓋高速度短時工況的不同作用~Comparing total hours alone hides the different effects of brief high-speed operation§所有運轉一小時造成的氣蝕損傷必定相同~Every operating hour necessarily causes the same cavitation damage§2.5+1+3.5§7
''')
add('b250','以鉸軸幾何受力傳遞與同步試運轉安裝弧門~Installing radial gates through trunnion geometry load paths and synchronized commissioning','算例為準靜態簡化構件，起吊與蓄水驗收仍須核准吊裝計畫、結構分析及現場量測。~Examples idealize quasi-static components; lifting and impoundment acceptance require approved plans structural analysis and field measurements.','敏感度：相同矩形投影寬度8m下，水深由6增至7m時水平靜水力由1412.64增至1922.76kN，增加36.11%；荷載按水深平方成長，不能用水位增加百分比直接放大全部構件反力。~Sensitivity: for an8m-wide rectangular projection, raising depth from6 to7m increases horizontal hydrostatic force from1412.64 to1922.76kN, or36.11 percent. This quadratic change does not imply the same factor for every component reaction.',r'''
曲面水壓與水平力~Curved pressure and horizontal force§弧門曲面上的靜水壓沿表面法線作用，理想同心圓弧的壓力線通過鉸軸，但合力仍須分解成水平與垂直分量。水平分量可用垂直投影面計算；此便利不表示閘門沒有重量、摩擦或偏心力矩，安裝幾何與受力必須共同核對。~Hydrostatic pressure acts normal to the curved skin, and ideal concentric normals pass through the trunnion. Resolve the resultant into horizontal and vertical components. The horizontal component follows the vertical projection, but weight, friction and eccentricity still create moments that depend on installed geometry.§Vertical rectangular projection from free surface: width=8 m; depth=6 m; horizontalForce=0.5*9.81*8*6**2=1412.64 kN§核對水位與曲面垂直投影尺寸並確認鉸軸位置~Check water level and projected dimensions and survey the trunnion position§圓弧中心偏離鉸軸會增加原本理想模型沒有的水壓力矩~A curvature center offset from the trunnion adds hydrostatic moment absent from the ideal model§理想弧門水壓通過鉸軸就代表全部荷載皆無力矩~Pressure passing through the trunnion means every gate load has zero moment§0.5*9.81*8*36§1412.64
曲面垂直分量~Vertical pressure component§曲面靜水力的垂直分量可由相應虛擬水體重量求得，方向取決於受壓面朝向與邊界。必須在自由體圖明示選用哪一水體，不能把曲面面積乘平均壓力當垂直力；此分量還會改變鉸支承反力與啟閉需求。~The vertical hydrostatic component corresponds to an appropriate imaginary water volume, with direction set by surface orientation. Show that volume explicitly in the free-body diagram; curved area times average pressure is not automatically a vertical force. This component also affects bearing reaction and operating demand.§Specified imaginary waterVolume=45 m3; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; verticalMagnitude=45*9.81=441.45 kN; direction from free body§以剖面圖圈選虛擬水體並與壓力向量積分交叉比較~Mark the imaginary volume on a section and compare it with pressure-vector integration§選錯虛擬水體或方向會錯估鉸支承垂直反力~Choosing the wrong volume or direction misstates vertical trunnion reaction§曲面面積乘平均壓力必然就是垂直水壓力~Curved area times mean pressure always equals vertical hydrostatic force§45*9.81§441.45
雙鉸軸同軸量測~Trunnion coaxiality surveying§左右鉸軸需要符合設計同軸與高程條件，偏差會使支臂扭曲並增加軸承摩擦。兩端高差除跨度只是小角度幾何示意，不代表完整三維同軸誤差；還需量測軸線方向、支座位置與溫度變化後的相對移動。~Both trunnions must satisfy alignment and elevation requirements. Misalignment twists arms and raises bearing friction. End-height difference divided by span illustrates one small-angle component, not full three-dimensional coaxiality; also survey axis orientation, support positions and temperature-dependent relative movement.§endElevationDifference=3 mm; span=10000 mm; smallAngle=3/10000=0.000300 rad§以獨立控制網量測兩鉸軸中心與方向並核對溫度~Survey both trunnion centers and directions from an independent network and record temperature§只核對中心高程會漏掉軸線方向偏斜~Checking center elevations alone misses angular axis misalignment§兩鉸中心同高就保證三維軸線完全同軸~Equal trunnion-center elevations guarantee complete three-dimensional coaxiality§3/10000§0.0003
軸承摩擦與啟閉~Bearing friction and operation§鉸軸摩擦把支承反力轉成阻力矩，潤滑不足、鏽蝕與偏心會改變摩擦係數。簡化庫侖摩擦式只估給定接觸狀態的量級，不能保證啟動與運轉摩擦相同；驗證應比較鉸反力、啟動力及運轉後溫升趨勢。~Trunnion friction converts bearing reaction into resisting torque. Lubrication, corrosion and misalignment change the coefficient. A Coulomb estimate describes a specified contact state and does not make breakaway and running friction identical; compare reaction, starting demand and subsequent temperature trends.§bearingReaction=1800 kN; frictionCoefficient=0.08; effectiveRadius=0.20 m; frictionTorque=1800*0.08*0.20=28.8 kN*m§比較啟動與穩定運轉的馬達電流及軸承溫升~Compare motor current at breakaway and steady travel with bearing temperature rise§摩擦上升可能把額外彎矩傳入原本主要受壓支臂~Rising friction can introduce additional bending into primarily compressed arms§軸承反力不變就表示摩擦力矩永遠不變~Constant bearing reaction guarantees constant friction torque§1800*0.08*0.2§28.8
吊索角度與張力~Sling angle and tension§門葉組裝吊運需依實際重心配置吊點，斜索張力會隨索角變小而增加。對稱兩索公式只適用靜態對稱分載，重心偏移、動態放大與吊具剛度需另列；教學幾何不能取代核准吊裝計畫與現場試吊觀測。~Assembly lifting requires pick points compatible with the actual center of mass. Sling tension increases as inclination becomes shallow. The symmetric two-sling equation assumes static equal sharing; eccentricity, dynamics and rigging stiffness require separate allowances and an approved lifting plan with observed load behavior.§totalWeight=400 kN; two symmetric slings60 degrees above horizontal; eachTension=400/(2*sin(60 degrees))=230.940 kN§以吊點荷重讀值核對分載並確認重心與吊索角度~Check sharing with pick-point load readings and confirm center of mass and sling angles§重心偏移可讓單側吊索超出對稱分載估計~An offset center of mass can overload one sling relative to symmetric sharing§兩根吊索不論角度都各承受總重的一半~Two slings each carry half the weight regardless of angle§400/(2*math.sin(math.radians(60)))§230.94010767585033
面板支承間彎曲~Skinplate bending between supports§門葉面板把分布水壓傳到肋材，再經主梁與支臂送至鉸軸，支承距離會強烈影響局部彎曲。簡支條帶模型只示範一維傳力，實際板的雙向作用、焊接拘束與曲率需另分析；驗證須核對肋距及面板厚度。~The skin transfers distributed pressure to stiffeners, girders and arms. Support spacing strongly affects local bending. A simply supported strip illustrates one-dimensional action only; plate action, welded restraint and curvature need separate treatment. Verify actual stiffener spacing and thickness before comparing measured deformation.§Unit-width strip: pressure=50 kPa; lineLoad=50 kN/m; span=1.2 m; simpleBeamMoment=50*1.2**2/8=9 kN*m per1m strip§量測肋間距與板厚並比較受水壓後局部撓度~Measure stiffener spacing and thickness and compare local deflection under water pressure§肋材漏焊或接續不良可能延長實際無支承跨度~Missing or defective stiffener welds can increase the effective unsupported span§面板總面積相同就保證局部彎曲完全相同~Equal total skin area guarantees identical local bending§50*1.2**2/8§9
支臂長細與屈曲~Arm slenderness and buckling§支臂承受壓力時需檢查整體穩定與局部板件屈曲，端部拘束會影響有效長度。歐拉公式僅適用理想彈性細長柱，不涵蓋初始彎曲、殘餘應力與組合彎矩；安裝偏差應進入模型而非只驗收截面積。~Compressed arms require global and local stability checks. End restraint affects effective length. Euler theory applies to an ideal elastic slender member and omits imperfections, residual stress and combined bending; installed deviations belong in the model rather than being ignored after checking area alone.§Ideal pinned elastic column: E=200e9 Pa; I=0.00008 m4; L=6 m; Pcr=pi**2*200e9*0.00008/6**2/1000=4386.49 kN§核對支臂初始直線度接點拘束與局部板件尺寸~Check arm straightness, connection restraint and local plate dimensions§鉸軸摩擦或偏心彎矩會降低理想軸壓模型的適用性~Trunnion friction or eccentric bending invalidates a purely axial idealization§理想歐拉屈曲力就是現場支臂可直接承受荷載~Ideal Euler load is the directly usable field capacity of the arm§math.pi**2*200e9*0.00008/36/1000§4386.490844928604
支座錨定與分載~Support anchorage and load sharing§鉸支座透過底板、錨定與混凝土把反力傳入壩墩，各螺栓受力通常因偏心與底板彈性而不均。平均分載只能作帳務起點；灌漿空洞、預緊差異與裂縫會改變接觸及荷載路徑，須配合局部模型與檢測。~Trunnion supports transfer load through plates, anchorage and concrete. Eccentricity and plate flexibility generally make bolt forces unequal. Equal sharing is only a bookkeeping start; grout voids, preload variation and cracking alter contact and load paths and need local analysis and inspection.§Ideal centered tension=800 kN; eight equal-stiffness anchors; averageTension=800/8=100 kN per anchor§核對預緊紀錄灌漿完整性與支座變形再比較分載~Review preload, grout continuity and support deformation before comparing load sharing§底板局部離縫會把拉力集中到少數錨栓~Local baseplate separation concentrates tension in a few anchors§總拉力除錨栓數就是每支錨栓的實際最大力~Total tension divided by anchor count equals every anchor maximum§800/8§100
側封壓縮與摩擦~Side-seal compression and friction§側封須在門葉運動範圍維持接觸，過少壓縮會漏水，過多則增加摩擦與磨耗。壓縮百分比是幾何量，不是接觸壓力的通用換算式；橡膠硬度、溫度與支承形狀需按供應商資料及實際接觸試驗確認。~Side seals need contact throughout travel. Too little compression leaks, while too much raises friction and wear. Compression percentage is geometry rather than a universal contact-pressure law; elastomer hardness, temperature and support shape require supplier information and representative contact testing.§FreeSealThickness=30 mm; installedThickness=24 mm; compression=(30-24)/30*100=20 percent§沿全行程量測封面接觸與啟閉阻力並定位滲漏~Measure seal contact and operating resistance throughout travel and locate leakage§偏斜門葉可使一側過壓縮而另一側失去密封~A skewed gate can overcompress one seal while unloading the other§止水壓縮越多就必定越好且沒有代價~More seal compression is always better and has no adverse effect§(30-24)/30*100§20
同步行程與試運轉~Synchronized travel and commissioning§雙側啟閉機不同步會造成門葉扭轉與封面不均，試運轉需逐工況核對行程、負荷與停留位置。兩側位移差除跨距僅是小角度扭斜指標；最終判定還需軸承、支臂與密封反應，不能只依位置訊號相近。~Unsynchronized drives skew the leaf and seals. Commissioning must compare travel, load and stopping positions across operating states. Differential travel divided by span is only a small-angle skew indicator; acceptance also requires bearing, arm and seal response rather than nearly equal position signals alone.§LeftTravel=1250 mm; rightTravel=1244 mm; spacing=12000 mm; skewIndicator=(1250-1244)/12000=0.0005 rad§同步記錄兩側行程與負荷並核對限位及停機後保持~Record both travels and loads synchronously and check limits and position holding§位置訊號一致但一側卡阻仍可能出現不均勻受力~Matching position signals can coexist with unequal force when one side binds§兩側位置讀值相同就保證兩側荷載相同~Equal side-position readings guarantee equal loads on both sides§(1250-1244)/12000§0.0005
''')
